       An EEVVPP__PPKKEEYY context can be obtained by calling:

           EVP_PKEY_CTX *pctx =
               EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_from_name(NULL, "X25519", NULL);

           EVP_PKEY_CTX *pctx =
               EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_from_name(NULL, "X448", NULL);

           EVP_PKEY_CTX *pctx =
               EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_from_name(NULL, "ED25519", NULL);

           EVP_PKEY_CTX *pctx =
               EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_from_name(NULL, "ED448", NULL);

       An XX2255551199 key can be generated like this:

           pkey = EVP_PKEY_Q_keygen(NULL, NULL, "X25519");

       An XX444488, EEDD2255551199, or EEDD444488 key can be generated likewise.

